WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.003
Customers lists everyone with an account, and anyone you add.

2
00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:08.559
Search by name, phone, email or pickup code.

3
00:00:08.559 --> 00:00:12.572
Open a customer to see their pull list.

4
00:00:12.572 --> 00:00:18.211
Pull List shows everything they have reserved and the series they follow.

5
00:00:18.211 --> 00:00:24.330
Add to Pull List finds a pre-order title to add while they’re at the counter.

6
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:30.086
Profile holds their details and private notes.

7
00:00:30.086 --> 00:00:34.228
New customer adds someone who doesn’t have an account yet.
